  <item>
    <title>03.婚姻（下）：婚内出轨还能过下去吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fd98f82d9eae5d0a735164</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fd98f82d9eae5d0a735164</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>婚内出轨能舍得下心离婚吗？结婚后还能不能激起浪花？给年轻人什么样的婚姻忠告？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello！大家好，我是企鹅。这一期顺着上期继续和Molly、Ada两位坐在一起讨论什么是婚姻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期录完之后，我印象最深刻的一点，是Molly讲的：恋爱的时候就要好好恋爱，不用考虑婚姻，到了婚姻的那一步再去慎重考虑婚姻。不管怎么说，进入任何一段认真的关系当中，我们都需要</span><strong><span>勇气</span></strong><span>。我们可能会收到伤害，可能会有创伤后的遗症，但即便如此，还是勇敢去爱吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>还可以关注一下我的公众号：</span><strong><span>Penguin饮水室</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">00:02:33</a> </span></strong><span>无法打破的「翻手机魔咒」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">00:06:01</a> 婚姻中对于另一半的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">00:12:17</a> Molly:面对婚姻裂痕的Plan B</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">00:22:54</a> Ada:被当作「假想敌」带来的无妄之灾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">00:32:25</a>深度绑定关系下不断被磨灭的「底线」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">00:38:23</a>虽然我出轨，你依然是我唯一爱的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">00:46:09</a>经营婚姻：在平淡中激起水花</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3241">00:54:01</a></span></strong><span>结语：对年轻人婚姻的启示</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：企鹅、Molly、Ada</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：牙膏</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：刘亚飞</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhyNaLtIkfPpTUjW2FLJIzO-r4Zr.m4a" length="84625190" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:20</itunes:duration>
